comp.sources.games	Index by Volume number		02/23/90

This is an index of the comp.sources.games archive, organized by volume
number, alphabetically within volumes. Patches appearing in later volumes
for earlier postings are archive under the original posting volume number.
[E.g. source and all patches for conquer4 are in volume6; source and all
patches for NetHack3 are in volume7.]

Some archive sites (e.g. uunet) archive by volume number. Others (e.g.
saab) archive strictly by game name. The following posting is an index
sorted by game name.

Unless otherwise noted, all files are compressed 16-bits, with a '.Z'
extension on the filename.

